COMPILATION OF: FCPS3

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: FCPS3

   1 a 0000 FCPS3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [FC-01] leading-framing probe on the PUT SKIP LIST
   4 a 0006      spelling: the FIRST executed output statement carries the
   5 a 0006      SKIP.  The measured bare-skip law (E29PS1: DR and mine
   6 a 0006      byte-identical) predicts a leading blank line here too;
   7 a 0006      predicted stream: blank, 'L= 1', 'M= 2' (M unterminated,
   8 a 0006      exit closes it). */
   9 c 0006   dcl l fixed;
  10 c 0006   dcl m fixed;
  11 c 0006   l = 1;
  12 c 000C   m = 2;
  13 c 0010   put skip list('L=', l);
  14 c 0037   put list('M=', m);
  15 c 0059   stop;
  16 a 005C end FCPS3;

CODE SIZE = 005C
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 388B
END  COMPILATION
